-- fren-covers: lang::identifier
-- A `«` that is never closed: a syntax error in Lean, and in the `fren`
-- command an identifier that is not Fren's (`Lexical.md#identifiers`).

proc c(«ab: Int) {}
--~^[hosted] error: unterminated identifier escape
--~^^[cli] error: `«ab: Int) {}…` is not an identifier in Fren
